    "biography": {
      "concept": "Careful scavenger who keeps turning up in new roles, always with Bit (tutorial+)",
      "notes": "Coll is Bit's partner, a careful, spare scavenger who keeps turning up alongside Bit in whatever new role the two have been given this time. Bit does the talking; Coll does the looking. Coll notices the detail the scene forgot to hide and names it carefully, 'the way you'd say it about a patient'. Coll answers everything asked and volunteers nothing, except continuity errors, which Coll cannot let go. Slow to warm up, and kind."
    }
  },
  "flags": {
    "bbttcc-onboarding": {
